```text
[courier-matcher-7f9c-2e3f] Application maximum poll interval (300000ms) exceeded by 41230ms: leaving group
[courier-matcher-7f9c-0a1b] rebalance: assigned partitions: orders.v1 [0, 1, 2]
[courier-matcher-7f9c-0a1b] handled order-8812 (partition 2, offset 15022)
```

```text
heartbeat.interval.ms=3000  session.timeout.ms=45000  max.poll.interval.ms=300000  max.poll.records=500
```

Statement: "The pod was removed because the time between two polls went over max.poll.interval.ms, not because heartbeats stopped; its uncommitted records were handed again to another member, so smaller batches or faster handling fix it."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'True. Heartbeats come from a background thread and kept the session alive; max.poll.interval.ms is a separate limit on the gap between two poll calls, and 500 records at roughly 0.7 s each took longer than 5 minutes. The member left the group, its partitions moved, and the new owner started from the last committed offset, so orders the slow pod had already matched were matched again. Lower max.poll.records, make each record faster, or raise max.poll.interval.ms deliberately; raising session.timeout.ms changes nothing here.', 3, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_kfk_131') AND order_index = 3)
    RETURNING id
)
